:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Mousse (Enemy)]].''
'''Mousse (Duck)''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 600
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Mousse (Duck)
|name2 = Mousse
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mousse''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Mousse, as a backliner, is a really good uber if you pull him. His ability to curse Aliens and Zombies is quite useless as zombies are usually strength orientated, and Aliens will usually have passive abilities like Waves or Strengthen, and even if they have an ability, it will be pretty useless. His Curse becomes even more irrelevant once you obtain [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Bakery Cat]], which fills the exact same role and has more targets, though Mousse does better in some sitiations. However, his niche is not the good thing about him, its that his extremely high range and piercing range makes him stackable, and also able to [[cheese]] stages. Some of these include [[Deathhawk (Deadly)|Deathhawk]], [[Boxing Clever (Expert)|Boxing Clever]], and other stages of the sort. Even better, he can outrange backliner enemies with his piercing range, like [[Camelle]] and his variants.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Crowd-Controller}}

